+---
+id: task-001-fix-order-service-report-defects
+type: task
+title: "Fix order-service report defects"
+status: pending
+format: 1
+---
+
+Fixed the three reported order-service defects:
+
+- Product lookup now canonicalizes submitted SKUs, accepting lower-case entries and surrounding spaces.
+- Goods totalling exactly €50.00 after discounts now qualify for free delivery.
+- Line VAT now rounds half up, so €1.99 at the standard rate produces €0.44 of VAT.
+
+Added regression coverage for all three reports. `npm test` passes (17 tests).
